    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93393" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σᾰρόω</span></b> ,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαίρω</span>
		(B), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sweep clean</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν οἰκίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
					15.8
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				2.33
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				253.7
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶκος σεσαρωμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
					12.44
				</span></i>
			, etc.: metaph., <i>to be swept clean, exhausted,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PGiss.
				11.19
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, of the thing <i>swept</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῦμα . . μεταξὺ χοιράδων σαρούμενον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					389
				</span></i>
			. Rejected by <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				63
			</span></i>.</div>
